# ==============================================================================
# 12. LINEAR INTEGRATION (INTELLIGENCE DATA PROVIDER)
# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Retrieves, normalizes, and feeds Linear project management data
# (issues, projects, cycles, velocity metrics) into the KogSync Intelligence Engine.
#
# ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLES:
# 1. Data Provider: Linear functions exclusively as an external intelligence provider.
#    It does NOT replicate the Linear UI inside KogSync.
# 2. Zero Database Storage Invariant: Zero database tables for issues, projects, or cycles.
#    Only OAuth connection credentials are encrypted at rest in public.organization_integrations.
# 3. Concurrency & Replay Guarantees:
#    - Single-use state nonce verified atomically via public.consume_oauth_nonce_atomic RPC.
#    - Distributed token refresh protected by PostgreSQL row lease (acquire_linear_refresh_lease).
#    - Optimistic Concurrency Control (OCC) commits via save_linear_refreshed_tokens_cas.
#
# SETUP TUTORIAL:
# 1. Visit Linear Developer Settings: https://linear.app/settings/api
# 2. Under "OAuth Applications", click "Create new application".
# 3. Configure the Application:
#    - Application Name: KogSync
#    - Developer / Company URL: https://kogsync.com
#    - Callback URLs:
#        * Local Dev:  http://localhost:3000/api/integrations/linear/callback
#        * Production: https://kogsync.com/api/integrations/linear/callback
# 4. Click "Create".
# 5. Copy "Client ID" into LINEAR_CLIENT_ID.
# 6. Copy "Client Secret" into LINEAR_CLIENT_SECRET.
# 7. Least-Privilege Scope: "read" (enforced automatically during authorization).
# ==============================================================================

# Linear OAuth Client ID.
# Visibility: Server-side only.
LINEAR_CLIENT_ID=placeholder_linear_client_id

# Linear OAuth Client Secret.
# Visibility: STRICTLY SERVER-SIDE.
LINEAR_CLIENT_SECRET=placeholder_linear_client_secret


